HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00dd.pdf,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00dd.pdf,b61239c668f0cc9943830684f06293b9d4c683f8a575d742291d1bab1a4e8cb8,158496,False,PDF可打开；首页可提取文本,51," HEALTH AND RETIREMENT STUDY 2000 Core Final, Version 1.0 September 2002 (Last revised April 2003) Data Description and Usage September 2002, Version 1 ii "
HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00qn/01HR00TC.pdf,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00qn/01HR00TC.pdf,6fbebac3b51b0ca4bea9787f6033b00423eb42b0c274aa6e108009dbb1f261ca,211303,False,PDF可打开；首页可提取文本,10," HEALTH AND RETIREMENT STUDY 2000 QUESTIONNAIRE HRS 2000 – TABLE OF CONTENTS SECTION CONTENTS PAGE Preface EXPLANATION AND OVERVIEW Page xx Section CS COVERSCREEN Page 1 Section A DEMOGRAPHICS Page 25 Section B HEALTH Page 40 Section PC PROXY COGNITION Page 73 Section C COGNITION Page 84 Section D FAMILY STRUCTURE Page 95 Section E HEALTH CARE UTILIZATION Page 199 Section F HOUSING Page 261 Section G EMPLOYMENT Page 298 Section GG EMPLOYMENT HISTORY: UNEMPLOYED, LAST JOB, NEW Rs Page 388 Section GH EMPLOYMENT HISTORY: PREVIOUS EMPLOYMENT, NEW Rs Page 403 Section GD EMPLOYMENT DISABILITY REINTERVIEW Rs Page 436 Section GJ EMPLOYMENT DISABILITY"
HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00qn/02hr00CS.pdf,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00qn/02hr00CS.pdf,19a52ad9a2002365ec84737423e6fccedfe431bf7a3c8ab439393d08e6229082,76857,False,PDF可打开；首页可提取文本,24,"HRS 2000 — COVERSCREEN — PAGE 1 FINAL VERSION 3  8/13/2002 NOTE: WHERE THERE IS MORE THAN ONE JUMP WITHIN A BRANCHPOINT BOX, THE JUMPS ARE TO BE APPLIED IN ORDER FROM THE TOP. CS0YY5. IWER: DO NOT SUSPEND AT THIS SCREEN! DOING SO MAY CAUSE DATA TO BE LOST IN THIS INTERVIEW AND/OR IN THIS R’S SPOUSE/PARTNER’S INTERVIEW! IS THE RESPONDENT WILLING/ABLE TO DO THE INTERVIEW? CHOOSING ""YES"" WILL CONTINUE THE INTERVIEW CHOOSING ""NO"" WILL TAKE YOU BACK TO CSMS IF THIS IS A POST-EXIT FROM A 1998 EXIT INTERVIEW or A RECONTACT FROM A 1998 POST-EXIT INTERVIEW: ANSWER ""NO"" AND GO BACK TO CSMS. THIS IS A POST-EXIT LINE. IF HAVE ALREADY ASSIGNED A FIRST R "
HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00qn/03hr00A.pdf,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00qn/03hr00A.pdf,373e0f429b72074e2bd6d7b3c481579185e453223759461784136dbfbf58f2dc,68399,False,PDF可打开；首页可提取文本,15,"HRS 2000  SECTION A: DEMOGRAPHICS  PAGE 25 FINAL VERSION 3  8/13/2002 NOTE: WHERE THERE IS MORE THAN ONE JUMP WITHIN A BRANCHPOINT BOX, THE JUMPS ARE TO BE APPLIED IN ORDER FROM THE TOP. A0. INTRO. Now I have some questions about your background. A1 BRANCHPOINT: IF THIS IS THE FIRST R, GO TO A1c BRANCHPOINT IF THIS IS {THE SECOND R and A REINTERVIEW R} and WE ALREADY KNOW R’s BIRTHDATE FROM PRELOAD, GO TO A1e BRANCHPOINT A1. In what month, day, and year were you born? A1. MONTH: 01. JAN 02. FEB 03. MAR 04. APR 05. MAY 06. JUN 07. JUL 08. AUG 09. SEP 10. OCT 11. NOV 12. DEC 98. DK 99. RF DK RF A1a. DAY DK RF A1b. YEAR A1c BRANCHPOINT: IF WE"
