HRS/data - 所有材料 - 副本/HRS/a93core/a93qn/B15_R.PDF,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/a93core/a93qn/B15_R.PDF,1c0dad1bcf4e7105aba86f2f23eb064d379b90d8353411f4eb14a0556ec94e2c,28412,True,PDF可打开；首页可提取文本,11,"AHEAD - WAVE 1 - 1993 - SECTION R - INSURANCE - PAGE 155 Version 3.00 11/02/98 R1. Health and health insurance are important areas of our study. You have already told us about Medicare, but there are many kinds of insurance that people use. R2. (STATE NAME FOR Medicaid) is a state program for people with low income or who are on public assistance. Sometimes people with very large medical bills are also covered by (Medicaid). Is your health care currently covered by (Medicaid)? 1.YES 5.NO 8.DK 9.RF GO TO R4 R3. Would you please give me the number from your Medicaid card? NUMBER AVAILABLE: 1.R WILLING - HAS CARD 2.R WILLING - KNOWS NUMBER 8.DK "
