HRS/data - 所有材料 - 副本/HRS/a95i/a95i.txt,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/a95i/a95i.txt,c293bab9bbf6425bd4d03e2b7a4449930f3b8c50e00d33019ef64475c9d0a201,431,True,文本已抽取；编码需按原文核对,,Data Alert: 1995 AHEAD Helper Imputation File Replaced 02/27/2003 The 1995 AHEAD Helper imputation file has been re-issued. The new file contains two identification variables not included before: PN (Person Number) and DHLPTYPE (1995 Helper Type). Users who downloaded the file before 02/27/2003 should use the updated 1995 AHEAD Helper imputation file to avoid problems when merging with the 1995 AHEAD Core Helper file. 
