HRS/data - 所有材料 - 副本/HRS/h00core/h00qn/20hr00SS.pdf,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00qn/20hr00SS.pdf,99165a8f8ef594da17706a30e606a999b628c366817e726b7dfe0b7faf6df1b3,5904,True,PDF可打开；首页可提取文本,1,"HRS 2000 — REQUEST SOCIAL SECURITY NUMBER — PAGE 767 FINAL VERSION 3  8/13/2002 CSYY50 BRANCHPOINT: IF THIS IS A PROXY INTERVIEW (CS1A={2 or 3}) or R PREVIOUSLY INDICATED HE/SHE WOULD NOT GIVE PERMISSION TO OBTAIN HIS/HER SOCIAL SECURITY NUMBER, GO TO SECTION RC CSYY50. One of the most important parts of our study is to understand the financial situations of people in their retirement years. In order to get complete data for this research, we are requesting the social security numbers of our respondents. [I will be sending you/I have with me] a letter explaining what kind of data will be obtained, and the care taken to protect our respondent"
HRS/data - 所有材料 - 副本/HRS/h00core/h00qn/21hr00RC.pdf,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00qn/21hr00RC.pdf,7bef5092b234e96d09267c17ee11e095e20d4ff22bccd4d60cd5813cf1750551,37501,True,PDF可打开；首页可提取文本,11,"HRS 2000 — SECTION RC: PROXIED RESPONDENT COGNITION — PAGE 768 FINAL VERSION 3  8/13/2002 RC-0a BRANCHPOINT: IF THIS IS NOT A PROXY INTERVIEW (CS1A {NOT 2 and NOT 3}) or R STARTED IW BUT GOT A LOW TICS SCORE AT C13Y5 (CS1C=4), GO TO MODULES RC-0a. May I speak to PROXIED RESPONDENT NAME and ask just a few questions? 1. R WILL TRY MODULE 3. PROXY R-SKIP MODULE 9. REFUSED BY R OR PROXY GO TO MODULES RC-0b. I have a few questions about the activities you are doing and how you like to spend your time. How often do you watch television often, sometimes, or never? 1. OFTEN 2. SOMETIMES 3. NEVER 8. DK 9. RF RC-0c. How often do you visit with family"
HRS/data - 所有材料 - 副本/HRS/h00core/h00qn/22hr00md.pdf,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00qn/22hr00md.pdf,00594d2a23803af6fc1de9dafe08dd79c406ddb4d349fd4f5c0f81300594b036,120804,True,PDF可打开；首页可提取文本,68,"HRS 2000  MODULES  PAGE 779 PRELIMINARY VERSION 1 OF QUESTIONNAIRE  FINAL VERSION 3  8/13/2002 *** BEWARE!!! *** NOTE: THIS SECTION IS NOT YET IN THE TYPICAL BOX-AND-ARROW FORMAT. THIS VERSION SHOWS THE PROPER CONTENT OF THE SECTION (QUESTION TEXT AND CODEFRAMES). HOWEVER, THE QUESTION FLOW (THE JUMPS) ARE INCOMPLETE AND NOT ENTIRELY ACCURATE. NOTE: ALL RESPONDENTS WERE RANDOMLY ASSIGNED A NUMBER AT VARIABLE 220. THIS VARIABLE DETERMINED WHICH MODULE EACH R WAS ASKED. EACH R WAS ASKED ONLY ONE MODULE. MODULE 1 BRANCHPOINT: IF THIS IS A PROXY INTERVIEW, GO TO END OF MODULES SECTION IF R ASSIGNED MODULE 1 (220=1) and R DOES NOT HAVE MEDICAR"
HRS/data - 所有材料 - 副本/HRS/h00core/h00qn/23hr00TN.pdf,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h00core/h00qn/23hr00TN.pdf,d4d1113f158064e0bb656224705d3599db969e05995355f413c8ccdd75b5202f,17555,True,PDF可打开；首页可提取文本,4,"HRS 2000 — SECTION TN: THUMBNAIL — PAGE > 800 FINAL VERSION 3  8/13/2002 NOTE: WHERE THERE IS MORE THAN ONE JUMP WITHIN A BRANCHPOINT BOX, THE JUMPS ARE TO BE APPLIED IN ORDER FROM THE TOP. TN0Y1. IWER: WHAT MODE IS INTERVIEW AT THIS POINT? 1. PHONE 2. F-T-F TN0Y2 BRANCHPOINT: IF THIS WAS A PROXY INTERVIEW (CS1A={2 or 3} or C13Y5=1), GO TO TN0Y4 TN0Y2. WAS THIS AN ASSISTED INTERVIEW? 1. NEVER 2. A FEW TIMES 3. MOST OR ALL OF THE TIME GO TO TN0Y4 TN0Y3. WHAT WAS THE RELATIONSHIP OF THE PERSON WHO ASSISTED R? 1. SPOUSE 2. CHILD/CHILD-IN-LAW 3. OTHER RELATIVE 4. OTHER INDIVIDUAL 5. PROFESSIONAL 7. OTHER (SPECIFY) TN0Y4. ABOUT WHAT PERCENT, IF A"
