HRS/data - 所有材料 - 副本/HRS/h2000wt/h00wtdes.txt,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h2000wt/h00wtdes.txt,8fc9428142cbca617f74bb54886d6937b624057dc28d81402c45c2e45a191f68,4419,True,文本已抽取；编码需按原文核对,,"--------------------------- Health and Retirement Study 2000 Early Release Weights Version 1 June 22, 2001 --------------------------- HRS early releases are provided within a very short time of the end of a data collection period. They are provided for the convenience of users who wish to begin analyzing data prior to a final release being available. Early release files are at the respondent level. The HRS 2000 early release weights files contain 19,581 respondents. Data alerts, new file notifications, and updates concerning the HRS 2000 early release weights files will be placed on the HRS Web Page at: http://www.umich.edu/~hrswww under Dat"
HRS/data - 所有材料 - 副本/HRS/h2002i/h2002i.txt,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h2002i/h2002i.txt,5ac0778ea55f1574b380fe617215574e20036ff70fbf355b6663751de017f8ec,731,True,文本已抽取；编码需按原文核对,,"HRS 2002 Imputation Final Release (Version 1) June 3, 2005 The HRS 2002 Imputation Final Release (Version 1) is now available. Covering twenty-one sections of the core interviews, the HRS 2002 Imputation Final Release contains data for 18,167 respondents and 12,350 households. The data collection period for the 2002 interview was February 2002 through March 2003. These files have NOT yet been approved for general use with SSA derived restricted data. Any requests to do so must be submitted formally through the restricted data group. If you find any problems with the data, please report to us by email at our help desk address, hrsquest@isr.umi"
