HRS/data - 所有材料 - 副本/HRS/h96core/h96dd.txt,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h96core/h96dd.txt,c8e4f033d235f88d50edc44be56f93f9edb18e76bcd7d91dbac2404b6589d2c3,103396,True,文本已抽取；编码需按原文核对,," HEALTH AND RETIREMENT STUDY 1996 Core Final, Version 4.0 September 2003 Data Description and Usage TABLE OF CONTENTS 1. Overview 1A. The Sample Interviewed in 1996 1B. What's Included in Version 4 1C. 1996 Questionnaire Sections 1D. Levels of Files in Version 4 2. File Naming Conventions 3. Data Files 4. Identification Variables 4A. Primary Identification Variables 4B. Primary Identification Variables for Datasets at Each of the Seven Levels 4C. Secondary Identification Variables 4D. Datasets Including ESUBHH and OPN as Primary Identifiers 5. Distribution Files and Directory Structure 5A. Distribution Files 5B. Directory Structure 6. Program"
HRS/data - 所有材料 - 副本/HRS/h96core/h96qn/01hr96cs.pdf,材料/HRS/data - 所有材料/HRS/h96core/h96qn/01hr96cs.pdf,a72c9abc66454b4ac3f3b9f98f4fd80a7e600e6b1fb322d3f1bdec124a3605ff,48782,True,PDF可打开；首页可提取文本,25,"HRS WAVE 3: SECTION CS (COVERSCREEN) HRS WAVE 3: SECTION CS (COVERSCREEN) HRS WAVE 3: SECTION CS (COVERSCREEN) HRS WAVE 3: SECTION CS (COVERSCREEN) PAGE PAGE PAGE PAGE 1 START OF IW TIME: ____________ IS THE RESPONDENT WILLING/ABLE TO DO THE INTERVIEW? CHOOSING ""YES"" WILL CONTINUE THE INTERVIEW CHOOSING ""NO"" WILL TAKE YOU BACK TO CSMS IF THIS IS A NEW SPOUSE/PARTNER THAT YOU ARE TRYING TO INTERVIEW AS THE FIRST R IN A COUPLE: YOU MUST INTERVIEW THE RECONTACT R FIRST, SO CHOOSE ""NO"" AND GO BACK TO CSMS. INAP.................................0 YES..................................1 NO...................................5 ASSIGN: WHICH HH PRELOAD "
